// Reference query, not verified against live data — no cost export has run
// yet (nothing in this component is deployed). Adapt once
// cost-export.bicep's CSV lands somewhere queryable (e.g. ingested into the
// Log Analytics workspace from component 05, or loaded into a query tool
// that reads the export container directly). Column names below match the
// documented Cost Management export schema at time of writing; verify
// against the first real export before trusting this as-is.
//
// Intent: cost broken down by the businessUnit tag (reserved for per-client
// cost separation, see 01-repo-foundation/README.md's tagging schema) and
// by resource, over the exported time range.
CostExport_CL
| summarize TotalCostUsd = sum(CostInBillingCurrency_d) by BusinessUnit = tostring(Tags_s["businessUnit"]), ResourceId = tostring(ResourceId_s), bin(UsageDate_t, 1d)
| order by TotalCostUsd desc
